The `@example` block uses assignment syntax (`deviceAddons = [...]`) rather than object-literal property syntax (`deviceAddons: [...],`). All other `@example` blocks on adjacent properties in this interface use the property form. This should read:
```ts
// .rnstorybook/main.ts
export default {
  deviceAddons: ['@storybook/addon-ondevice-controls'],
};
```
Same applies to line 429.
